alongside NFC, ASCII and a joined emoji, and compare 28 explicitly authored
colored pen strokes with the exact PDF/PNG generated from seven repeats of
mixed Unicode glyphs.

The rendered pages match byte-for-byte and remain
bounded by existing 96-grapheme placed-text admission. This is a source
traversal change, not an asserted speed-up measurement or glyph synthesis.

